Rule 4 (cropping values must be smaller than the input dimensions in channels_last mode)
{v_1 : tuple(int), v_2 : str, v_3 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_3) = 5 ∧ v_1.len = 3 ∧ v_2 = "channels_last" then shape(v_3, 1) > 2 * v_1[0] ∧ shape(v_3, 2) > 2 * v_1[1] ∧ shape(v_3, 3) > 2 * v_1[2]
